&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-redactor-tag=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;The Role…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exciting new sales opportunity for an enthusiastic and customer focused individual who has a passion for homeware and interiors to join the Soho Home retail team. There is a full-time position available in our brand new Central London location&lt;/p&gt;
